# @DIST@

Typed [msgspec](https://github.com/msgspec/msgspec) models for OCSF @OCSF@, generated by
[ocsf-toolkit](https://github.com/k4otix/ocsf-toolkit) @VERSION@. Do not edit: regenerate.

```python
from ocsf_toolkit import build, parse
from @PACKAGE@ import DetectionFinding
```

Every class and object is a msgspec Struct and every enum is referenceable by its OCSF caption.
`ocsf_toolkit.build()` and `ocsf_toolkit.parse()` take and return these classes. Classes are
supersets: attributes that a profile or an extension adds are optional, and `build()` enforces what
the event's profiles require. `ocsf-toolkit generate --profiles` emits exact classes for one profile
set.

This package bundles the OCSF @OCSF@ schema it was generated from and runs on ocsf-toolkit
`@CORE@`. Documentation: [Typed models](https://github.com/k4otix/ocsf-toolkit/blob/main/docs/models.md).
